7 0 obj
<< /Length 1080 >>
stream
BT /F1 26 Tf 72 760 Td (Tuning the Tuner) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 718 Td (Learning an optimiser's hyperparameters by backpropagation) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 699 Td (A report from the Torvane Laboratory for Optimisation Research) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 680 Td (Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 658 Td (Every gradient-based training run carries settings that somebody has to choose, such as a step) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (size. This report shows that those settings can be differentiated through the update itself and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 630 Td (learned along with the weights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 616 Td (The same trick applies to the settings of the settings, so stacks of any height can be built and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 602 Td (trained together.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 588 Td (On dense, convolutional and recurrent workloads the learned optimiser matched a hand-tuned) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 574 Td (one and needed far fewer sweeps to get there.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 518 Td (Prepared for software testing. The text is fictional.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (1) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
