stream
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (1 Starting point) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (People who train models spend a lot of time on the optimiser's own settings: a step size, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (momentum term, decay rates. These are usually picked by hand or by a sweep.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (The idea here is to differentiate the loss with respect to those settings, so that they can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (learned in the same loop as the weights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (On all three architectures we tried ó dense, convolutional and recurrent ó the learned) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (optimiser remained stable when its starting hyperparameters were badly chosen, and it became) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 654 Td (more stable as the stack of optimisers grew.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (Tuning the Tuner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (2) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
