11 0 obj
<< /Length 1017 >>
stream
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (2 The method) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (Take an update at step t that depends on a setting such as the step size. If that update is written) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (into the graph, the derivative of a later loss with respect to the setting comes out of the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (backward pass that supplies the weights' gradients.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (Keeping every step's graph would be far too expensive, so after each update the weights are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (cut loose from the step before. Were the update graph kept whole, backpropagation's linear) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (cost would turn the run quadratic and make it impractical.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 654 Td (Nothing in the model's definition needs to change. What is needed is the update's computation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 640 Td (graph, kept long enough for derivatives to pass through it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (Tuning the Tuner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (3) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
