BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (5 In practice) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (One drawback is a slower start: for the first few hundred steps the top-level rates are large and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (the estimates noisy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (The wrapper holds the update from the previous step and detaches it, so one step's graph is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (never joined back into the next.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (A few ready-made modules simply cannot be wrapped, because they rewrite the computation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (graph without saying so while keeping state of their own.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 654 Td (For those we supply an explicit cell with the same interface and no hidden graph changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (Tuning the Tuner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (10) Tj ET
endstream
