BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (6 Closing remarks) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (The optimiser's settings can be learned by the very gradient descent that learns the model,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (provided the update is written into the graph and cut free between steps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (The method is cheap, stacks to any height, and makes training less sensitive to a person's first) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (guess.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (Where a sweep over learning rates is expensive, it should pay for itself; the code is released for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (others to try on their own models.) Tj ET
